y watching  the game and that makes a world of  difference for investors this will no  doubt have been attractive especially  considering blizzards initial pitch was  an idea without a product to show for it  on the next episode of this series we  speak to some of the people with the  biggest stakes in the overwatch league  the team owners who have invested  millions in purchasing franchises and  the managers and coaches who dedicate  their lives to running them  [Music]

